### 5. **Inventory Dashboard**

* **Page Title**: Inventory Overview
* **Purpose**: Display current inventory of devices and peripherals
* **Description**: Displays real-time inventory status for all available hardware and peripherals. Enables IT and procurement teams to plan restocking, detect shortages, and track aging equipment. With color-coded statuses and summary widgets, users can quickly assess inventory health and make procurement decisions accordingly. This page serves as the operational hub for daily hardware visibility.
* **Page Title**: Inventory Overview
* **Purpose**: Display current inventory of devices and peripherals
* **Description**: Displays real-time inventory status for all available hardware and peripherals. Enables IT and procurement teams to plan restocking, detect shortages, and track aging equipment.
* **UI Components**:

  * **Filter Panel**:

    * Device Type (Laptop/Peripheral dropdown)
    * OS Type (Mac/Windows dropdown)
    * Availability (Available / Unavailable / In Use)
  * **Summary Cards**:

    * Total Available Devices
    * Total In Use
    * Peripheral Count
  * **Inventory Table**:

    * Columns: Device Type, Model, Status, Last Updated
    * Tag/Badge for status
    * Pagination
* **Interactions**:

  * Dropdown filters trigger re-rendering of inventory list
  * Status shown as colored badges (green: available, red: unavailable, grey: in use)

